                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W4792900                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNCTION   :  TO CREATE A REPORT FOR FILE FROM W4792800             *        
*                THIS WILL BE FUTHER SENT FOR D&P                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*  AUTHOR     :  UMESH JAIN G                                          *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
FILE W47929D1 FB (179 0)                                                        
%W479028                                                                        
*                                                                               
FILE W47929D2 VB (133 0)                                                        
UT-HEADER          1 133    A                                                   
UT-IDDC-LEV        1   2    A                                                   
FIL1               3   1    A                                                   
UT-IDDISTR         4   4    N                                                   
FIL2               8   1    A                                                   
UT-IDKUNDNR        9   8    N                                                   
FIL3              17   1    A                                                   
UT-DEPT           18   2    N                                                   
FIL4              20   1    A                                                   
UT-KDORDKL        21   1    N                                                   
FIL5              22   1    A                                                   
UT-ORDER          23   8    N                                                   
FIL6              31   1    A                                                   
UT-KOLLI          32   8    N                                                   
FIL7              40   1    A                                                   
UT-ORDERLINE      41   8    N                                                   
FIL8              49   1    A                                                   
UT-KVLEVART2      50   8    N                                                   
FIL9              58   1    A                                                   
UT-VIKTVOL        59   8    N                                                   
FIL10             67   1    A                                                   
UT-VOLVOL         68   8    N                                                   
FIL11             76   1    A                                                   
UT-COSTVOL        77   9    N                                                   
FIL12             86  48    A                                                   
                                                                                
FILE REP1 VIRTUAL RETAIN FB (70    7000)                                        
R-IDDC-LEV         1   2    A                                                   
R-IDDISTR          3   3    P                                                   
R-IDKUNDNR         6   4    P                                                   
R-DEPT            10   2    N                                                   
R-KDORDKL         12   1    P                                                   
R-IDORDNR5        13   5    N                                                   
R-IDKOLLI         18   3    P                                                   
R-TALLY           21  10    P  0                                                
R-KVLEVART2       31  10    P  0                                                
R-VIKTVOL         41  10    P  3                                                
R-VOLVOL          51  10    P  1                                                
R-COSTVOL         61  10    P  2                                                
                                                                                
FILE REP2 VIRTUAL RETAIN FB (77    7700)                                        
S-IDDC-LEV         1   2    A                                                   
S-IDDISTR          3   3    P                                                   
S-IDKUNDNR         6   4    P                                                   
S-DEPT            10   2    N                                                   
S-KDORDKL         12   1    P                                                   
S-IDORDNR5        13   5    N                                                   
S-TALLY           18  10    P  0                                                
S-ORDERLINE       28  10    P  0                                                
S-KVLEVART2       38  10    P  0                                                
S-VIKTVOL         48  10    P  3                                                
S-VOLVOL          58  10    P  1                                                
S-COSTVOL         68  10    P  2                                                
                                                                                
FILE REP3 VIRTUAL RETAIN FB (82    8200)                                        
T-IDDC-LEV         1   2    A                                                   
T-IDDISTR          3   3    P                                                   
T-IDKUNDNR         6   4    P                                                   
T-DEPT            10   2    N                                                   
T-KDORDKL         12   1    P                                                   
T-TALLY           13  10    P  0                                                
T-KOLLI           23  10    P  0                                                
T-ORDERLINE       33  10    P  0                                                
T-KVLEVART2       43  10    P  0                                                
T-VIKTVOL         53  10    P  3                                                
T-VOLVOL          63  10    P  1                                                
T-COSTVOL         73  10    P  2                                                
                                                                                
W-COSTVOL    W     10 P 2                                                       
W-VIKTVOL    W     10 P 2                                                       
W-VOLVOL     W     10 P 2                                                       
W-FIRST      W     1 A VALUE 'Y'                                                
                                                                                
W-HEADER-REC W     84 A  VALUE +                                                
'DC;DIST;CUST;DEPT;CLASS;ORDER;CASES;LINES;PIECES;WEIGHT;VOL;COST'              
                                                                                
JOB INPUT W47929D1                                                              
IF PRARTNTO = 0                                                                 
  W-COSTVOL    EQ KVLEVART2 * PRARTNTO-LOC                                      
ELSE                                                                            
  W-COSTVOL    EQ KVLEVART2 * PRARTNTO                                          
END-IF                                                                          
W-VIKTVOL    EQ KVLEVART2 * VKARTNTO * 1000                                     
W-VOLVOL     EQ KVLEVART2 * VLARTNTO / 100                                      
PRINT REP1                                                                      
                                                                                
REPORT REP1 SUMMARY  SUMFILE  REP1  SPACE 0                                     
SEQUENCE IDDC-LEV IDDISTR IDKUNDNR IDDEPT KDORDKL IDORDNR5 IDKOLLI              
CONTROL  IDDC-LEV  NOPRINT IDDISTR NOPRINT IDKUNDNR NOPRINT IDDEPT +            
         NOPRINT KDORDKL NOPRINT IDORDNR5 NOPRINT IDKOLLI NOPRINT               
LINE KVLEVART2 W-VIKTVOL W-VOLVOL W-COSTVOL                                     
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT REP1                                                                  
PRINT REP2                                                                      
                                                                                
REPORT REP2 SUMMARY  SUMFILE  REP2  SPACE 0                                     
SEQUENCE R-IDDC-LEV R-IDDISTR R-IDKUNDNR +                                      
R-DEPT R-KDORDKL R-IDORDNR5 R-IDKOLLI                                           
CONTROL  R-IDDC-LEV  NOPRINT R-IDDISTR NOPRINT +                                
         R-IDKUNDNR NOPRINT R-DEPT   +                                          
         NOPRINT R-KDORDKL NOPRINT R-IDORDNR5 NOPRINT                           
LINE R-TALLY R-KVLEVART2 R-VIKTVOL R-VOLVOL R-COSTVOL                           
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT REP2                                                                  
PRINT REP3                                                                      
                                                                                
REPORT REP3 SUMMARY  SUMFILE  REP3  SPACE 0                                     
SEQUENCE S-IDDC-LEV S-IDDISTR S-IDKUNDNR +                                      
S-DEPT S-KDORDKL S-IDORDNR5                                                     
CONTROL  S-IDDC-LEV  NOPRINT S-IDDISTR NOPRINT +                                
         S-IDKUNDNR NOPRINT S-DEPT   +                                          
         NOPRINT S-KDORDKL NOPRINT                                              
LINE S-TALLY S-ORDERLINE S-KVLEVART2 S-VIKTVOL S-VOLVOL S-COSTVOL               
*                                                                               
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT REP3                                                                  
    IF W-FIRST = 'Y'                                                            
      UT-HEADER = W-HEADER-REC                                                  
      PUT W47929D2                                                              
      W-FIRST = 'N'                                                             
    END-IF                                                                      
                                                                                
    UT-IDDC-LEV    =   T-IDDC-LEV                                               
    UT-IDDISTR     =   T-IDDISTR                                                
    UT-IDKUNDNR    =   T-IDKUNDNR                                               
    UT-DEPT        =   T-DEPT                                                   
    UT-KDORDKL     =   T-KDORDKL                                                
    UT-ORDER       =   T-TALLY                                                  
    UT-KOLLI       =   T-KOLLI                                                  
    UT-ORDERLINE   =   T-ORDERLINE                                              
    UT-KVLEVART2   =   T-KVLEVART2                                              
    UT-VIKTVOL     =   T-VIKTVOL                                                
    UT-VOLVOL      =   T-VOLVOL                                                 
    UT-COSTVOL     =   T-COSTVOL                                                
    FIL1           =  ';'                                                       
    FIL2           =  ';'                                                       
    FIL3           =  ';'                                                       
    FIL4           =  ';'                                                       
    FIL5           =  ';'                                                       
    FIL6           =  ';'                                                       
    FIL7           =  ';'                                                       
    FIL8           =  ';'                                                       
    FIL9           =  ';'                                                       
    FIL10          =  ';'                                                       
    FIL11          =  ';'                                                       
    FIL12          =  ' '                                                       
    IF UT-IDDISTR = 778  878  974  978  1090                                    
      PUT W47929D2                                                              
    END-IF                                                                      
*                                                                               
